copy at BODY ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types [] text ""
-> copies ""
copy at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types [] text ""
-> copies "hello"
copy at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types [] text ""
-> the page set "the page's own"
copy at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types [] text ""
-> canceled
cut at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types [] text ""
-> copies "hello"
beforeinput deleteByCut null "hello world" 0,5
input deleteByCut null " world" 0,0
paste at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types ["text/plain"] text "XY" after setData "XY"
-> pastes "XY"
beforeinput insertFromPaste "XY" " world" 1,1
input insertFromPaste "XY" " XYworld" 3,3
paste at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types ["text/plain"] text "no" after setData "no"
-> canceled
cut at i ClipboardEvent trusted true true true true types [] text ""
-> the page set "the page's own"